","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every event’s category, ","type":"text"},{"code":"e_c","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", such as the app’s name. Each event’s action,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"e_a","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", is its name.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"category"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracking plan of every event the destination is given."}]}],"name":"plan"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What sends each request."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"transport"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How long to wait before each new attempt at a request; 1 second, doubling up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to 60 seconds, with full jitter, by default."}]}],"name":"backoff"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The clock the waits are measured on.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"clock"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time a batch is encoded at, which the 23 hours are measured from,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and each request’s deadline is checked against before it is sent; the system’s clock by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default. When it reads NaN or infinite, every record is left out."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"now"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The destination.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The destination posts bulk tracking requests to the installation’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"matomo.php","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", encoded by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder"},{"text":" within ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/batchLimit"},{"text":", and sends no trace context","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in its header fields. It retries no response, a 5xx, 408 or 429, and drops and reports any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other status, such as 400 for a body Matomo can’t read.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The destination sends no ","type":"text"},{"code":"token_auth","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and takes none: a token is a secret, and any secret","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an app holds is public. Matomo takes events from anyone who can reach it, so the destination","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"builds on every platform. Without a token, Matomo takes no event tracked more than a day","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before it arrives, so the encoder leaves out a record tracked more than 23 hours before it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is encoded (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoEncodingError\/timestampOutsideWindow"},{"text":"). A request is encoded once and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retried as it is, so one still undelivered 23 hours after its oldest record was tracked, by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the time ","type":"text"},{"code":"now","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gives, isn’t sent again: it is dropped and reported as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDropReport.deadlineExceeded(deadline:recordIDs:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", rather than reach Matomo too late to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"